> summary :
> this patch splits the dual functionality of the "unexplored/dark area"
> glyph into two separate glyphs. one for unexplored areas, and one for dark
> parts of a room. a new tile for "Darkroom" areas is also supplied. it only
> comes into affect if "lit_corridor" and "color" are both on, it then draws
